'''An''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Dragontail}} that sells materials found on the [[Crimson Isle]]. They only sell items to members of the Barbarian [[Faction]].

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
! colspan="2" | Condition
! Dialogue
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | Not in the [[Barbarian Faction]]
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &dAn&f: I don't sell my items to people who don't work with us.}}
|-
{{Crimson Isle 4 Villager Barbarian Dialogue|&dAn}}
|-
|-
| class="ct" rowspan="3" |{{zone|The Garden}}
| class="ct" | None
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &aAn&f: Someone just bought up my entire stock of Nether Wart! Could you help me replenish my supply?}}
|-
| class="ct" | Completing
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &aAn&f: Thanks. Hopefully I won't run out again.}}
|-
| class="ct" | Denying
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &aAn&f: Looks like I'll have to find something else to sell.}}
|}

== Trivia ==
* '''An''' has the shortest name of any [[NPC]].

