'''Arbadak''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Scarleton}}.

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
! colspan="2" | Condition
! Dialogue
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | First Interaction
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &dArbadak&f: Just because you don't understand something doesn't mean it's not possible!
&e[NPC] &dArbadak&f: Not even a century ago teleportation was thought to be impossible!
&e[NPC] &dArbadak&f: And you yourself are capable of telepathy and telekinesis, which nobody knew were even possible recently!
&e[NPC] &dArbadak&f: Oh, who are you?
&e[NPC] &dArbadak&f: Can you not disturb our conversation?
}}
|-
| class="ct" colspan="2" rowspan="4" | None <br> (Random)
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &dArbadak&f: Don't disrespect your elders.}}
|-
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &dArbadak&f: Stop eavesdropping!!!}}
|-
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &dArbadak&f: Please leave us alone.}}
|-
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &dArbadak&f: You are being very rude.}}
|-
{{Crimson Isle 4 Villager Mage Dialogue|&dArbadak}}
|}

== Trivia ==
*'''Arbadak'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s name is the "Kadabra" backwards, a word associated with the phrase "Abracadabra Alakazam". It is often used in magic.

