The '''Argofay Threebrothers''' are a group of three [[NPC]]s located in the {{Zone|Wyld Woods}}. Each of them appears in one of the three trees there and provides dialogue. After speaking to all three, each of them will offer to sell the player a {{Item|Wyld Sword}}.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
! colspan="2" | Condition
!Dialogue
|-
| class="ct" | First Brother
| class="ct" | First interaction
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: It's rare to meet new faces around these &awoods&f.
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: Especially one who is so &cill-prepared&f!
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: I don't have it on me, but one of my &atwo brothers&f should have a spare &aweapon&f.
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: If you run into them, tell them I sent you.
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: They will know what it means.
}}
|-
| rowspan="3" class="ct" | Second Brother
| class="ct" | First interaction
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: It's rare to meet new faces around these woods.
&eSelect an option: &a[Your brother sent me.]
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Selecting {{Rmt|&a[Your brother sent me.]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: That is suspicious.
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: He wouldn't let you leave so &cill-prepared&f.
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: My other brother should have a spare weapon.
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: Whatever you do, do not call him by his name, that might trigger him to use it on you.
&eSelect an option: &a[I don't know his name.]
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Selecting {{Rmt|&a[I don't know his name.]}}
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: Perfect.}}
|-
| rowspan="2" class="ct" | Third Brother
| class="ct" | First interaction
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: It's rare to meet new faces around these &awoods&f.
&eSelect an option: &a[I am ill-prepared.]
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Selecting {{Rmt|&a[I am ill-prepared.]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: What a strange thing to say.
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: Did you talk with my &abrothers&r?
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: Anyway, you're right...
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: But I do have a &aweapon &rthat could help you!
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | None<br>{{DG|Having spoken to one brother}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: Try and find one of my &abrothers&f.
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: They should be able to equip you with a &aweapon&f.
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | None<br>{{DG|Having spoken to two brothers}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: Try and find one of my &abrothers&f.
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: They keep a spare &aweapon&f around for new faces.
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | None<br>{{DG|Having spoken to three brothers <br> without owning a {{Item|Wyld Sword}}}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: I have a spare &aweapon&f.
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: Here.
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | None<br>{{DG|Having spoken to three brothers <br> while owning a {{Item|Wyld Sword}}}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: A spare weapon?
&e[NPC] Argofay Threebrother&f: Are you sure you're not mistaking me with someone else?
}}
|}

== Trivia ==
* "Argofay" is likely [[w:Pig Latin|Pig Latin]] for "Fargo".

