'''Button''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{Zone|Wizardman Bureau}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
'''Button''' serves as a source of information for how to call {{NPCSprite|Wizardman}} into the {{Zone|Wizardman Bureau}}.

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
!Condition
!Dialogue
|-
| class="ct" | First Press
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Button&f: Ouch!
&e[NPC] Button&f: That tickles more than you'd think!
&e[NPC] Button&f: A little gentleness goes a long way, you know?
&e[NPC] Button&f: There's a &e&lRING&f hologram right above. Try using that, would you?
&e[NPC] Button&f: Sigh, the things I endure... Youth these days indeed!
&eSelect an option: &a[I'm sorry.]
}}
|-
| class="ct" |Selecting {{Rmt|&a[I'm sorry.]}}
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Button&f: All forgiven. Just, maybe click on &e&lRING&f next time?}}
|-
| class="ct" | Clicking the {{Rmt|&e&lRING}} hologram above
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Button&f: Ah, seeking Wizardman? They're currently on a cosmic errand.
&e[NPC] Button&f: If you say "&cHelp Wizardman!&f" I am sure they will come save you.
}}
|-
| rowspan="7" class="ct" | Pressing again before calling for {{NPCSprite|Wizardman}}
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Button&f: That's the spot! Just kidding, please click the &e&lRING&f.}}
|-
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] Button&f: Ahhh! That actually hurts, you know!}}
